rktuMFTpZhQa0z6zV0ViiDSz-skMN_Y_B9K4wFHdlK5KO9C_3X4u-1XFp0fGeDqVj52COrQDb-41L1jWz7kcM75AXrzHd3CvGmOU-BCYAPK2ua-IIJxgrDaKJm8fYNQ43AQyvST7PS4A7P57NBLPpn_cb2qZgR4-QSzpFdrcQ_Ro2iyAk08YHUtQJnjA3gOARAZqfHQmf8c0oBzWsAy0bhCyLx6lOfH5rIWWGnxs9BvjAK5ZHO1olEeob_Lo0UJ91vyR0sifsuDqr-m2vVGIKoV1svzbUszQJGCZYdh_P_76-vGXN_-K_oN4hsYIvrYMrrVFrDTWpjNGB2hpZ74VcywgTi1fmvyzV-1Wk-MY5UOm-a4ffn6UoNiPeXabqj01l4NMUOdyiitMiX48l7EAbTdgkDjK6w_MLVe00QwOO3U42cWppDLB5hAWv1ha6BSg3xnHPraeO3_00oftWyDAQQPVN0YgI3uWXMAiqwBixmHxT8irs14i6eAXoReL3KH9YwD0v9M5_o3zVicxMKVUtZ1JzgQ=="},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_09b52967a043482d016adf3c4ea33c8191a605862430cab85b","call_id":"call_ed182922b4a14a22b805a070ef594864","name":"record_review_item","arguments":"{\"pointer\":\"/nodes/P\",\"coverage\":\"assessed\",\"judgment\":{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"notes\":\"Independently compared original H001–H006/P (source-original.txt lines 7–77, 695–718), source-context definitions D003–D005/D013–D014, the complete inspected type, and Proof.lean lines 5–30, 1451–1452. All parameters and hypotheses agree: p is prime, K is any characteristic-p field, lam is an integer in [0,p), V is a finite complex module of dimension lam+1, v is a nonzero highest-weight vector, and M is an arbitrary simultaneous integer/complex-basis lattice. The three bracket relations define precisely an sl2(C) action; common invariant complex subspaces express irreducibility, and H005 supplies the stated highest weight. Additive subgroups are Z-submodules; reindexing the simultaneous basis by Fin(lam.toNat+1) uses H003/H004, not an additional restriction. Stability under every DP is equivalent to stability under their generated integer algebra. IntegralOps has agreement fields on every lattice element and inherited brackets, not an assumed irreducibility field; T007 constructs it from H004/H006. Its restrictions are unique by subtype injectivity, so the existential in the conclusion cannot select a different action. VK is K tensor_Z M, canonically the flipped source tensor with its K action; only this ordering is used in Lean. T006, T017–T019 give actual checked localization/residue/basis conversions, and T020 proves operator intertwining. Nontrivial and bottom/top give exactly nonzero and zero/whole. The generators span the Chevalley algebra, so K-linear invariance under them is equivalent to module invariance without faithfulness. This also covers lam=0 and p=2: no distinct reduced weights or division by 2 is required, and factorial inversions are confined to indices below p. No algebraic closure or minimal-lattice assumption is present.\",\"locations\":[\"/endpoints/P/source\",\"/endpoints/P/actual\",\"/endpoints/P/correspondence\",\"/scope/full_target\",\"/scope/parameters\",\"/scope/hypotheses\",\"/documents/0\",\"/documents/1\",\"/documents/2\"]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read one declared frozen document. For JSON use pointer (empty string lists the root); large objects return keys, and strings resume with offset=next_offset. For text use inclusive start/end lines and column=next_column when continuing a long line. Every serialized result is at most 32 KiB. Follow has_more and the returned continuation coordinates; no arbitrary local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"st